[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800200_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800200_03_0010","text":"制作人……\n那个……肩膀上……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800200_03_0020","text":"樱花花瓣……\n好多……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800200_03_0030","text":"哦哦，是吗\n刚才走过樱花林荫道来着"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800200_03_0040","text":"……啊\n头顶上……也有……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800200_03_0050","text":"诶\n是吗……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800200_03_0060","text":"……呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800200_03_0070","text":"哈哈，有什么好笑的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800200_03_0080","text":"制作人也是……\n樱花的妖精……先生……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800200_03_0090","text":"——诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800200_03_0100","text":"和春天……一起……\n走着呢……"}]
